{"id":"c8a8e90864ab15ce","group":"90","path":"90/90-ex-rosser-sentence-construction.md","title":"Rosser Sentence Construction","display":"ex-rosser-sentence-construction — Rosser Sentence Construction","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-ex-rosser-sentence-construction","aliases":["90-ex-rosser-sentence-construction"],"display":"ex-rosser-sentence-construction — Rosser Sentence Construction","depends_on":["[[90-df-provable]]","[[90-df-rosser-sentence]]","[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal]]","[[90-df-representability-theorem]]","[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-ex-rosser-sentence-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-ex-rosser-sentence-construction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-rosser-sentence-construction — Rosser Sentence Construction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00ee901093c12d44\" href=\"?note=00ee901093c12d44\" title=\"90-df-provable\">90-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7c51b51998a67f02\" href=\"?note=7c51b51998a67f02\" title=\"90-df-rosser-sentence\">90-df-rosser-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"00035e09fe6018d6\" href=\"?note=00035e09fe6018d6\" title=\"90-df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal\">90-df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"31a1cb59fb59977d\" href=\"?note=31a1cb59fb59977d\" title=\"90-df-representability-theorem\">90-df-representability-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g,d,T\">\\(S,g,d,T\\)</span> 为同一有效算术编码环境，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a> 的已选公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"00035e09fe6018d6\" href=\"?note=00035e09fe6018d6\" title=\"90-df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal\">90-df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal</a>；它是递归的全函数，故 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"31a1cb59fb59977d\" href=\"?note=31a1cb59fb59977d\" title=\"90-df-representability-theorem\">90-df-representability-theorem</a> 提供算术公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta(v,z)\">\\(\\eta(v,z)\\)</span>，使对每个标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\vdash\\forall z(\\eta(\\bar n,z)\\leftrightarrow z=\\overline{\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}(n)})\">\\(Q\\vdash\\forall z(\\eta(\\bar n,z)\\leftrightarrow z=\\overline{\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}(n)})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RosserSent}\">\\(\\mathrm{RosserSent}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"7c51b51998a67f02\" href=\"?note=7c51b51998a67f02\" title=\"90-df-rosser-sentence\">90-df-rosser-sentence</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\land\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\ \\mathrm{RosserSent}_T(R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\land\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\ \\mathrm{RosserSent}_T(R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>选择新鲜变量，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho(v):=(v=v)\\land\\forall p\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Prf}_T(p,v)\\to\n\\exists z\\bigl(\\eta(v,z)\\land\\exists q(q\\le p\\land\\mathrm{Prf}_T(q,z))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho(v):=(v=v)\\land\\forall p\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Prf}_T(p,v)\\to\n\\exists z\\bigl(\\eta(v,z)\\land\\exists q(q\\le p\\land\\mathrm{Prf}_T(q,z))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>用对角引理取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash R\\leftrightarrow\\rho(\\overline{g(R)})\">\\(T\\vdash R\\leftrightarrow\\rho(\\overline{g(R)})\\)</span>。固定标准输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=g(R)\">\\(n=g(R)\\)</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 的逐输入唯一值性质，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}(g(R))=g(\\neg R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}(g(R))=g(\\neg R)\\)</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 内把变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 消去。所得等价式恰为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"7c51b51998a67f02\" href=\"?note=7c51b51998a67f02\" title=\"90-df-rosser-sentence\">90-df-rosser-sentence</a> 的原定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保持原来 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\le p\">\\(q\\le p\\)</span> 的 Rosser 比较，不改成严格不等号。编码否定是元理论函数，不直接作为对象语言项写进算术公式；本构造以表示公式消去它。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"00ee901093c12d44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-rosser-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"7c51b51998a67f02","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-rosser-sentence]]","embe