ved","id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,g,d,T$ 为同一有效算术编码环境，$\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)$，且 $\\mathrm{Prf}_T$ 是 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 的已选公式。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal","status":"resolved","id":"00035e09fe6018d6","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}$ 见 [[90-df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal]]；它是递归的全函数，故 [[90-df-representability-theorem]] 提供算术公式 $\\eta(v,z)$，使对每个标准 $n$ 有 $Q\\vdash\\forall z(\\eta(\\bar n,z)\\leftrightarrow z=\\overline{\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}(n)})$。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-representability-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"31a1cb59fb59977d","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}$ 见 [[90-df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal]]；它是递归的全函数，故 [[90-df-representability-theorem]] 提供算术公式 $\\eta(v,z)$，使对每个标准 $n$ 有 $Q\\vdash\\forall z(\\eta(\\bar n,z)\\leftrightarrow z=\\overline{\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}(n)})$。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory","status":"resolved","id":"002c574215686062","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{REAx}$ 取 [[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-rosser-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"7c51b51998a67f02","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{RosserSent}$ 取 [[90-df-rosser-sentence]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-rosser-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"7c51b51998a67f02","anchor":"ref-17","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Proof]","excerpt":"用对角引理取 $R$ 满足 $T\\vdash R\\leftrightarrow\\rho(\\overline{g(R)})$。固定标准输入 $n=g(R)$，用 $\\eta$ 的逐输入唯一值性质，以及 $\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}(g(R))=g(\\neg R)$，在 $T$ 内把变量 $z$ 消去。所得等价式恰为 [[90-df-rosser-sentence]] 的原定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,g,d,T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta(v,z)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\vdash\\forall z(\\eta(\\bar n,z)\\leftrightarrow z=\\overline{\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}(n)})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RosserSent}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\land\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\ \\mathrm{RosserSent}_T(R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho(v):=(v=v)\\land\\forall p\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Prf}_T(p,v)\\to\n\\exists z\\bigl(\\eta(v,z)\\land\\exists q(q\\le p\\land\\mathrm{Prf}_T(q,z))\\bigr)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash R\\leftrightarrow\\rho(\\overline{g(R)})","display":false},{"tex":"n=g(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}(g(R))=g(\\neg R)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"q\\le p","display":false}],"bytes":2186,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-161","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-ex-berry-paradox-formal.md]]\n[[90-ex-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-ex-diagonalization-method.md]]\n[[90-ex-godel-sentence-construction.md]]\n[[90-ex-quine-construction.md]]\n[[90-ex-quine-sentence.md]]\n[[90-ex-rosser-sentence-construction.md]]\n[[90-ex-russell-paradox-set.md]]\n[[90-ex-self-reference-program.md]]"}],"outgoing":["00ee901093c12d44","7c51b51998a67f02","8c071ce52fa72de0","f57084ad3c1a7029","d53b945955293235","714deb184f73887a","00035e09fe6018d6","31a1cb59fb59977d","002c574215686062","278a6c2cfc6160a3","61d70aa13427c3b5"]}